{"version":1,"id":"drake-do-not-disturb","title":"Do Not Disturb","artist":"Drake","key":"Dm","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/drake/do-not-disturb/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Drake, Mr Shebib, Allen Ritter, Matt Samuels, Linda Jackson and Leven Kali","chords":[{"symbol":"Gm","canonical":"Gm","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,10,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Dm","canonical":"Dm","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,5,9],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, stylin' though","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Dissin’ but got pictures with me smilin' though","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"All the things you need, you still want problems though","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"All the things I know, I still been silent though","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, used to be at SilverCity, Indigo","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Used to be in lunchroom, playin' dominoes","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I don’t want to have to go to funerals","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I gotta start sleepin' at the studio","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't have no time to be no Romeo","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"All the love I need is at the rodeo","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"All the love I need is here at OVO, yeah","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"All the girls I know are there with E and Tho","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Who knows where I end up when that shit gets old?","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe it never gets old and that's just how it goes","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Last table left in Carbone, callin' plays on the rotary phone","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I take a glass of Domina to go with me home","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Might move our annual shit to the 'Dome","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I need 40,000 people to see what I'm on","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, ducked a lot of spiteful moves","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"I was an angry yout when I was writin' Views","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Saw a side of myself that I just never knew","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"I’ll probably self-destruct if I ever lose, but I never do","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Steady doin’ double shifts","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"1da doin' the beat and I open up like a double click","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"More blessings because I’m generous","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Thirty-seater plane for like ten of us","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Remember when I bought Sealey the fake Chanel wallet","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"She knew that shit was a fraud but never told me about it","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Nowadays when we catchin' up we just laugh about it","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Can't describe what my life is like when she asks about it","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Scary whenever I close my eyes at night","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Wakin' up to public statements about my private life","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"I can never sleep ’til morning on all my quiet nights","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"But you can rest assure that my mind is right","columns":45,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Get no sick days, I leave for like three months in six days","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Never stick around to see shit change","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Get lil' updates, texts in my inboxes have been poppin'","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Seasons go by like I'm binge-watchin'","columns":37,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"Went from Club Palazzo in the Bridge to Club LIV","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"To not even showin' up at a club 'less we doin' bis'","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"I can't even party while a nigga pursuin' this","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"Distractions will do you in, in the truest sense","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"lyric","text":"Especially people that want to lecture me","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"And frame it like they just want the best for me","columns":48,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"Or they check for me, whatever splits it up","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"So there's more for them and there's less for me","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"They don't know they got to be faster than me to get to me","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Gm","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"lyric","text":"No one's done it successfully","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"7AM in Germany, can't believe that they heard of me","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-50","kind":"lyric","text":"Last verse that I gotta do is always like surgery","columns":49,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-51","kind":"lyric","text":"Always tryin' to let go of anything that'll burden me","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":30,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-52","kind":"lyric","text":"That's the reason you can feel the tension and the urgency","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":36,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-53","kind":"lyric","text":"Last chance I get to make sure that you take it personally","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-54","kind":"lyric","text":"Take this shit to heart, it's always executed perfectly","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-55","kind":"lyric","text":"If we do a song it's like takin' my kids to work with me","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-56","kind":"lyric","text":"You overnight celebrity, you one day star","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-57","kind":"lyric","text":"Swear I Told You that I'm in this bitch for eternity","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":36,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-58","kind":"lyric","text":"I am a reflection of all of your insecurities","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-59","kind":"lyric","text":"Behind closed doors, a lot of 6 God worshipping","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-60","kind":"lyric","text":"Done talk now, 'cause there's other shit that's concernin' me","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-61","kind":"lyric","text":"There's real ones around me","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-62","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to make sure they learn from me","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-63","kind":"lyric","text":"I want to see my dog, but his grandmother's his surety","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":38,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-64","kind":"lyric","text":"He can't even dip out to see me in an emergency","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":26,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-65","kind":"lyric","text":"My life is centered 'round competition and currency","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-66","kind":"lyric","text":"Takin' summer off, 'cause they tell me I need recovery","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-67","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe gettin' back to my regular life will humble me","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Gm","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-68","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll be back in 2018 to give you the summary","columns":44,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-69","kind":"lyric","text":"More Life","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[]}]}